{# 1. Our Story #}
<section class="section" id="story" aria-labelledby="story-head">
  <div class="wrap cols cols--sidebar">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 id="story-head">Eighteen years on Faizabad Road</h2>
      <p>{{ site.name }} was established in {{ site.established }} on Faizabad Road, Chinhat, as part of the {{ site.parentOrganization }}. It began with a simple aim: to give students in this growing part of the city access to recognised, career-focused higher education close to home.</p>
      <p>Over eighteen years the college has grown into a multi-disciplinary campus offering seven programmes. These are four undergraduate degrees affiliated to the {{ site.affiliation.university }} (BBA, BCA, B.Com and B.Sc Agriculture), and three teacher-education programmes recognised by the National Council for Teacher Education (B.Ed, M.Ed and D.El.Ed). Its <span class="ph">[number]</span>+ alumni now work in business, information technology, banking, agriculture and schools across Uttar Pradesh.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0">
      <img src="{{ images.about.url }}" alt="{{ images.about.alt }}" width="{{ images.about.width }}" height="{{ images.about.height }}"
           loading="lazy" style="border-radius:var(--radius-lg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-2)">
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

