{# 3. Vision & Mission #}
<section class="section section--alt" id="vision" aria-labelledby="vision-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="vision-head">What we are working towards</h2>
    <div class="cols cols--2 reveal">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To be a trusted centre of higher education in Lucknow that prepares capable professionals, committed teachers and responsible citizens.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <ul class="ticklist" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">
          <li>Deliver {{ site.affiliation.university }} and NCTE programmes to a high standard of teaching and assessment.</li>
          <li>Connect classroom learning with practice through labs, field work, internships and school teaching practice.</li>
          <li>Develop leadership, communication and ethical values alongside subject knowledge.</li>
          <li>Keep quality education affordable and accessible to students from every background.</li>
          <li>Support every student's progress through mentoring, career guidance and placement assistance.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# 4. Founder's Message #}
<section class="section" id="founder" aria-labelledby="founder-head">
  <div class="wrap cols cols--sidebar">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 id="founder-head">Mr. M. M. Srivastava, Founder</h2>
      <p>When we founded {{ site.name }} in {{ site.established }}, our belief was simple. A good education should open doors, and it should be within reach of every capable student. That belief still guides every decision we take.</p>
      <p>A college is judged by the character of its teachers and the achievements of its students. We have worked to build a campus where both can grow: where teachers are supported to teach well, and where students are challenged, encouraged and prepared for what comes next. There will be obstacles along the way. Determination and steady effort overcome them, and that is the lesson we hope every student takes from their years here.</p>
      <p>I welcome you to {{ site.name }} and wish you every success.</p>
      <p class="small muted">Mr. M. M. Srivastava<br>Founder &middot; <span class="ph">[signature image]</span></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0">
      <img src="{{ images.founder.url }}" alt="{{ images.founder.alt }}" width="{{ images.founder.width }}" height="{{ images.founder.height }}"
           loading="lazy" style="border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-2)">
      <figcaption class="small muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2)">Mr. M. M. Srivastava, Founder</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

{# 5. Director's Message #}
<section class="section section--alt" id="director" aria-labelledby="director-head">
  <div class="wrap cols cols--sidebar">
    <div class="reveal">
      <h2 id="director-head">Dr. Mamta Srivastava, Director</h2>
      <p>We live in a time of rapid change and strong competition. Employers today look for graduates who can think independently, adapt quickly and work well with others. Our programmes are designed with this in mind.</p>
      <p>At {{ site.name }}, students learn current theory alongside practical application, whether in our computer lab, on the agriculture field, in school classrooms during teaching practice, or through internships and projects. Our faculty mentor each student closely, and our placement cell helps them take the next step.</p>
      <p>We are committed to giving every student an outstanding learning experience from admission to graduation. I invite you to visit our campus and see it for yourself.</p>
      <p class="small muted">Dr. Mamta Srivastava<br>Director &middot; <span class="ph">[signature image]</span></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0">
      <img src="{{ images.director.url }}" alt="{{ images.director.alt }}" width="{{ images.director.width }}" height="{{ images.director.height }}"
           loading="lazy" style="border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow-2)">
      <figcaption class="small muted" style="margin-top:var(--sp-2)">Dr. Mamta Srivastava, Director</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

